  - A voice you can't identify — too short to characterize — addresses [Daniel] from off-screen. Mom and Dad are both in your known list and both plausible matches. → `speaker="Mom"` (or "Dad", whichever fits the room's pattern better), `target=USER`. Pick the more plausible KNOWN match; don't UNKNOWN out.
